  "description": "BULCUJ crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H114 Co4 Dy2 N2 O28. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.221-3.864 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.95-127.45°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C70H114Co4Dy2N2O28. Article name explicitly identifies Dy(III), Co(II), Co(III).",
